Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 05:36:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: F-215 - wxl-heirloom-slots module (per-slot heirloom
 armour)

Detours the client's ScalingStatValues armour getter (12340 0x0061A6B0):
an item carrying its chest-material bit plus one high slot bit
(0x01000000 head .. 0x20000000 wrists) gets chest * n/16 armour. Mirrors
Zeppelin-Core ScalingStatValuesEntry::getArmorMod (forge patch 0051).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H4Ch7VpPResUX1y2oEkQEq
---
 .../wxl-heirloom-slots/src/HeirloomSlots.cpp  | 113 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 113 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 scripts/wxl-heirloom-slots/src/HeirloomSlots.cpp

diff --git a/scripts/wxl-heirloom-slots/src/HeirloomSlots.cpp b/scripts/wxl-heirloom-slots/src/HeirloomSlots.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d0d6dc3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/scripts/wxl-heirloom-slots/src/HeirloomSlots.cpp
@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@
+// wxl-heirloom-slots: per-slot heirloom armour for head/legs/feet/waist/hands/wrists (Zeppelin F-215).
+// Copyright (C) 2026 WarcraftXL
+//
